The test fixture writer tools/dwg-r2000.mjs (not part of the app) writes DWG
R2000 files from the publicly available "Open Design Specification for .dwg
files" (Open Design Alliance). No vendor software was decompiled,
disassembled or copied.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
File formats
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The DXF reader and writer (src/formats/dxf.js, dxf-write.js) were written from
the publicly published DXF reference. No vendor software was decompiled, disassembled or copied.
src/formats/dwg.js maps the objects LibreDWG decodes to the same DXF semantics.
"DXF", "DWG" and "DGN" are used only to name the file formats this app opens.

------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not bundled
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Playwright (Apache-2.0) is used only to run the end-to-end tests and to render
the PNG app icons; it is not part of the app and is not redistributed.
